===Etymology 2===
Named after the landmark U.S. Supreme Court case [[w:Village of Euclid v. Ambler Realty Co.|''Village of Euclid v. Ambler Realty Co.'']], which in turn refers to the city of [[w:Euclid, Ohio|Euclid, Ohio]].

